{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation (vs avgpool) in a multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA-only model. Validation accuracy of 0.653 (F1: 0.628) slightly outperforms the avgpool baseline (config_005 accuracy 0.65), though F1 is nearly identical. Uncertainty remains about the significance of the aggregation method's impact and the potential benefits of other design choices like RNA encoder variations or multimodal components."
}

